00:11:22,638 --> 00:11:24,251
six hundred ninety.

296
00:11:24,431 --> 00:11:26,499
That is a ladder of ten thousand,

297
00:11:26,499 --> 00:11:27,752
two hundred dollars.

298
00:11:27,932 --> 00:11:30,215
And the first big step on that

299
00:11:30,215 --> 00:11:32,269
ladder is four-wheel drive,

300
00:11:32,269 --> 00:11:35,313
which adds three thousand dollars on the

301
00:11:35,313 --> 00:11:37,900
S trims, and about three thousand,

302
00:11:37,900 --> 00:11:40,259
three hundred on the SV and the

303
00:11:40,259 --> 00:11:40,563
PRO.

304
00:11:40,914 --> 00:11:42,849
The twist is what that does to

305
00:11:42,849 --> 00:11:44,269
the Tacoma comparison.

306
00:11:44,449 --> 00:11:46,710
The fifteen dollar gap is for the

307
00:11:46,710 --> 00:11:49,383
cheapest crew cab with two-wheel drive.

308
00:11:49,563 --> 00:11:52,166
But many buyers who want a midsize

309
00:11:52,166 --> 00:11:54,692
truck also want four-wheel drive,

310
00:11:54,692 --> 00:11:57,754
and the four-wheel drive Frontier S crew

311
00:11:57,754 --> 00:11:59,821
cab is thirty-six thousand,

312
00:11:59,821 --> 00:12:01,429
eight hundred ninety.

313
00:12:01,609 --> 00:12:03,826
We do not have a matching Tacoma

314
00:12:03,826 --> 00:12:05,835
price in the sources we used.

315
00:12:06,015 --> 00:12:08,673
So the honest answer is that the

316
00:12:08,673 --> 00:12:12,412
headline comparison applies to one trim only.

317
00:12:12,762 --> 00:12:15,638
Next, the comparison with the other cheap

318
00:12:15,638 --> 00:12:17,812
trucks, from the Autoblog list.

319
00:12:17,992 --> 00:12:19,259
The Ford Maverick,

320
00:12:19,259 --> 00:12:22,497
twenty-eight thousand, one hundred forty-five.

321
00:12:22,677 --> 00:12:24,612
The Tacoma SR XtraCab,

322
00:12:24,612 --> 00:12:28,482
thirty-two thousand, one hundred forty-five.

323
00:12:28,662 --> 00:12:31,123
The Chevrolet Colorado work truck,

324
00:12:31,123 --> 00:12:33,584
thirty-two thousand, four hundred.

325
00:12:33,764 --> 00:12:35,358
The Ford Ranger XL,

326
00:12:35,358 --> 00:12:38,966
thirty-three thousand, three hundred fifty.

327
00:12:39,146 --> 00:12:42,266
And the twenty twenty-seven Frontier S King

328
00:12:42,266 --> 00:12:44,080
Cab, thirty-two thousand,

329
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:45,531
four hundred ninety.

330
00:12:45,711 --> 00:12:48,245
The Frontier sits right in the middle

331
00:12:48,245 --> 00:12:49,066
of the pack.

332
00:12:49,417 --> 00:12:51,474
That middle position matters,

333
00:12:51,474 --> 00:12:53,956
because the buyer has real choices.

334
00:12:54,136 --> 00:12:58,419
For about thirty-two to thirty-three thousand dollars,

335
00:12:58,419 --> 00:13:00,956
you can choose a Tacoma with the

336
00:13:00,956 --> 00:13:03,811
best resale, a Colorado with a turbo

337
00:13:03,811 --> 00:13:05,397
